		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1bb53dd elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="1bb53dd" data-element_type="section" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;ekit_has_onepagescroll_dot&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-48dd1fb5" data-id="48dd1fb5" data-element_type="column" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
								<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-35bf57a9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="35bf57a9" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Keep Kabwe Clean, <span style="color: darkgreen;">Green </span>& Healthy</h2>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-40849521 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="40849521" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p><em>Let’s build the <span class="underline">Zambia we want!</span></em>.</p>						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-11f65c52 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="11f65c52" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>The Ministry of Local Government and Rural Developement has unveiled the Keep Zambia Clean, Green and Healthy Communication Strategy (2024-2028). Supported by a robust legal framework, the strategy aims to inspire the behavioural changes essential for effective solid waste management across communities.</p>						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3b06fd8d elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="3b06fd8d" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;ekit_we_effect_on&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}" data-widget_type="button.default">
